Audits.

There shall be an annual independent audit-of all city accounts, funds, and financial transactions by a certified public accountant selected by the city council. The audit shall be conducted according to generally accepted auditing

‘principles. Any audit of any funds by the state or federal - governments may be accepted as satisfying the requirements of this charter. Copies of annual audit reports shall be available at printing costs to the public. ;
